sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as You
    participant A as App
    participant G as Gateway
    participant W as Worker
    participant M as Muse Spark
    P->>A: Publish, "Own interface"
    A->>G: POST /v1/jobs
    G-->>A: 202 · jobId
    A-->>P: "Being built,<br/>use the chat meanwhile"
    W->>G: GET /v1/worker/next<br/>(long poll, 25 s)
    G-->>W: the job + earlier source
    loop ≤ 25 calls · 15 min · 3 failed builds
        W->>M: chat + 5 tools
        M-->>W: write_screen · build_bundle · finish
        W->>W: Gradle + Ketoy:<br/>errors go back to the model
    end
    alt the request is unclear
        W->>G: needs_info + a question
        A-->>P: the question on the card
        P->>A: your answer
        A->>G: POST …/answer, queued again
    else it compiles
        W->>G: signed .ktx + source
    end
    loop every 3 s, then 6 s
        A->>G: GET /v1/jobs/{id}
    end
    G-->>A: done · url · sha256 · entry point
    A->>G: GET /v1/bundles/{id}.ktx
    A->>A: SHA-256 + Ed25519 check
    A-->>P: The agent opens in its own screen
